  "text": "Your intuitive understanding of magic allows you to read the energy of a spell in the air. You gain the Analyze Magic spellshift.\n\nSpellshift—Analyze Magic Once you've homed in on a spell or magical effect, you can study its unique magical signature to immediately understand exactly what it does.\n\nCritical Success You learn information about the spell or effect as if you had critically succeeded at a skill check to Identify Magic using the appropriate skill for its magical tradition.\n\nSuccess You learn information about the spell or effect as if you had succeeded at a skill check to Identify Magic using the appropriate skill for its magical tradition.",
